message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "relab-rpi-cam-plugin: Raspberry Pi camera plugin for the Relab platform"
abstract: >-
  Device-side software for automated image capture on Raspberry Pi, integrated with the
  Reverse Engineering Lab (Relab) platform. A FastAPI service captures still images with
  per-capture camera metadata, serves a live preview, pairs to Relab over an outbound
  WebSocket relay with device-signed tokens, and uploads captures with a disk-backed retry
  queue.
